# promise: #906
# Cra's data folder moved to another disk with a symbolic link left in its place: a space on a profile of its own
# showed black pages. Chromium resolves its user data folder through the link and creates a profile only right inside
# it, and Cra named the profile's folder through the link: chromium.log said "Cannot create profile at path". Cra now
# resolves the data folder before naming any folder inside it, so the Work space's page loads.
